{"articleNo":"1526","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1526&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010년 하반기 교육역량강화사업 기기교육 안내(CNC 레이저가공기)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.12.03","hit":"10125","attachments":[{"name":"레이저가공기 교육신청서(교육역량강화사업).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1526&attachNo=70984"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;본 부속공장에서는 2010년도 하반기 교육역량강화사업의 일환으로 학생들의 공작능력을 향상시키기 위하여 기기이용자(CNC 레이저가공기)교육을 아래와 같이 실시하고자 하오니 희망하는 학생들은 많은 참여 바랍니다.\n<p align=\"center\">- 아 래 - </p>\n<p align=\"left\">1. CNC 레이저가공기 교육&nbsp;안내<!--StartFragment--> </p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#c0c0c0\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"85\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">기기명</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#c0c0c0\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"165\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">교육일시</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#c0c0c0\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"210\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">교육내용</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#c0c0c0\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"74\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">대상</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#c0c0c0\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"89\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">교육장소</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"81\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"85\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">CNC&nbsp; </p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">레이저가공기</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"81\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"165\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">12. 20(월) ~12. 21(화) </p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">09:30 ~ 17:30</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"81\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"210\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">▷ 원리 및 Operation 교육 </p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;- Laser Machine의 가공원리 </p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;- CAD/CAM 기본 작성기능 </p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;- 기기조작 및 실습교육</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"81\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"74\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">학부 및 </p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">대학원생</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"81\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"89\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">U126호 </p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">부속공장&nbsp;</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n※ 교육이수증 발급 (단 중도퇴실시 발급하지 않음)<br>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">2. 신청방법 및 접수 <br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 접수기간 : 12. 6(월) ~&nbsp;12. 10(금) <br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 신청방법 : 교육신청서 제출 <br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 접수처 : 부속공장 사무실 (054) 478 - 7218~9 <br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 라. 신청서식 : 부속공장 홈페이지 자료실 또는 부속공장 사무실 비치 <br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">3. 교육강사 : (주)아마다 코리아 교육담당자<!--StartFragment--> <br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
